msgid ":class:`!set`, :class:`!frozenset`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"See :class:`dict` as the :class:`set` and :class:`frozenset` implementations "
"are similar, and the same caveats apply. In the worst case, *O*\\ (1) "
"operations instead take *O*\\ (*n*) time, and operations that look up every "
"element degrade accordingly."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A :class:`frozenset` is :term:`immutable`, so it does not support adding, "
"discarding, or the in-place update operations. The others below apply to it "
"at the same costs."
msgstr ""

